@startuml
package "Agent" {

  package "AutoConfiguration" {
    class ApAutoConfigurationTask
  }

  package "Tasks" {
    class TrafficSeparationTask
  }

  package "TrafficSeparation" {
    class TrafficSeparationManager
    abstract class PortPlumbing
    class TrunkPortPlumbing8021q
    class AccessPortPlumbing8021q
    struct sTrunkPort
    struct sAccessPort
    struct sTrafficSeparationConfig
  }

  class AgentDB
  class slave_thread
  class TaskPool
  class broker_client
  class BPL_CFG
  class network_utils
}

' TS triggers are routed through slave_thread
ApAutoConfigurationTask --> AgentDB : read BH, FH BSS, \nprofiles etc
ApAutoConfigurationTask --> slave_thread : task_pool_try_send_event(TRAFFIC_SEPARATION, TS_ENABLE)
slave_thread --> AgentDB : read boot-time multi_ap_profile\n+ is_multiap_profile_1_as_of_r4\nstore WDS iface
slave_thread --> TaskPool : add_task(TrafficSeparationTask)\nwhen profile supports TS\nor R4-as-R1 compatibility mode
slave_thread --> TaskPool : try_send_event(TRAFFIC_SEPARATION, TS_ENABLE)\ntry_send_event(TRAFFIC_SEPARATION, TS_NEW_WDS_IFACE, iface_name)\ntry_send_event(TRAFFIC_SEPARATION, TS_CLEAR_WDS_IFACE, iface_name)
slave_thread --> slave_thread : cache pending WDS iface notification\nuntil process_client_association()
TaskPool --> TrafficSeparationTask : handle_event() only when task exists

' TrafficSeparationTask interactions
TrafficSeparationTask --> AgentDB : read TS DB state,\nradio/BSS/port inventory\nmatch exact WDS iface to active bBSS
TrafficSeparationTask --> BPL_CFG : read private/guest bridge names
TrafficSeparationTask --> broker_client : configure_primary_vlan_id()\nconfigure_interfaces()
TrafficSeparationTask --> TrafficSeparationManager : reset()\nconfigure(cfg)\nadd_trunk_port(trunk)\nremove_trunk_port(trunk)\nadd_access_port(access)\napply_policies()\nclear_policies()
TrafficSeparationTask --> slave_thread

' Manager → plumbing
TrafficSeparationManager --> PortPlumbing : apply(cfg)\nclear()
PortPlumbing <|-- TrunkPortPlumbing8021q
PortPlumbing <|-- AccessPortPlumbing8021q

' Plumbing → OS/network helpers
TrunkPortPlumbing8021q --> network_utils : create_vlan_interface()\nlinux_add_iface_to_bridge()\nset_interface_state()
AccessPortPlumbing8021q --> network_utils : set_vlan_packet_filter()

note bottom of TrafficSeparationTask
  - keep TS_ENABLE on the debounced full-rebuild path
  - handle exact WDS ifaces with immediate add/remove events
  - let slave_thread defer exact-WDS add until association is valid
  - rebuild only persistent DB ports during full reset
end note

@enduml
